2026-11-22T19:25:35.0259659Z pluginval - 2.0.0
2026-11-22T19:25:35.0383873Z Tests at strictness level 10:
2026-11-22T19:25:35.0384237Z 
2026-11-22T19:25:35.0384878Z   Plugin info: Logs getName(), getAlternateDisplayNames(), supportsDoublePrecisionProcessing(), getLatencySamples(), getTailLengthSeconds()
2026-11-22T19:25:35.0386432Z   Locale stability: Checks that the plugin doesn't change the system locale. Some plugins or GUI frameworks change locale settings (e.g., decimal separator from '.' to ','). This can corrupt preset files, break float parsing in other plugins, or crash the host
2026-11-22T19:25:35.0387744Z   Plugin programs: Calls getNumPrograms() and getProgramName() for each, then randomly switches programs 5 times via setCurrentProgram()
2026-11-22T19:25:35.0388563Z   Editor: Calls createEditor() twice (cold and warm), logs time taken, expects non-null editor pointer
2026-11-22T19:25:35.0389327Z   Plugin state: Saves state via getStateInformation(), randomises all automatable params, restores via setStateInformation()
2026-11-22T19:25:35.0390257Z   Automatable Parameters: For each non-bypass automatable parameter: logs index, name, defaultValue, label, numSteps, isDiscrete, isBoolean, isAutomatable, category
2026-11-22T19:25:35.0391439Z   Audio processing: Processes 10 blocks at each sample rate / block size combo. For instruments, sends noteOn/noteOff. Checks for NaNs, Infs, subnormals
2026-11-22T19:25:35.0392329Z   Automation: Processes in 32-sample sub-blocks, randomly changing up to 10 params between each. Subnormals treated as errors
2026-11-22T19:25:35.0393241Z   Open editor whilst processing: Starts async thread calling processBlock() repeatedly, then calls createEditor() on message thread. Tests concurrent access
2026-11-22T19:25:35.0394730Z   Bus layout processing: For every supported combination of mono/stereo on each input and output bus (including sidechain), calls setBusesLayout(), prepareToPlay() and processBlock(). Detects crashes in plugins that mis-handle non-default channel counts (e.g. mono main with stereo sidechain).
2026-11-22T19:25:35.0396504Z   Basic bus: Tests audio bus configuration: lists all supported input/output layouts (named channel sets like stereo/5.1 and discrete channels), tests enableAllBuses() and disableNonMainBuses(), then verifies the default layout can be restored
2026-11-22T19:25:35.0397732Z   Editor Automation: With editor open, loops 1000x calling setValue(random) on ALL parameters with 10ms sleep between iterations
2026-11-22T19:25:35.0398458Z   vst3 validator: Runs Steinberg's vstvalidator with -e flag for extended validation (VST3 only)
2026-11-22T19:25:35.0399134Z   auval: Runs 'auval -strict -stress 20 -v <type> <subtype> <manu>' (Audio Units only)
2026-11-22T19:25:35.0400212Z   Fuzz parameters: For each parameter, sets 5 random values and calls getValue(), getText(), getValueForText(), getCurrentValueAsText(). Tests that text/value conversion functions don't crash or hang with arbitrary inputs
2026-11-22T19:25:35.0401048Z   Editor stress
2026-11-22T19:25:35.0401748Z   Plugin state restoration: For each param: saves original value, randomises, restores state, expects value within 0.1 of original. Also requires exact binary state match
2026-11-22T19:25:35.0402740Z   Non-releasing audio processing: Same as audio processing, but calls prepareToPlay() at new sample rate WITHOUT calling releaseResources() first
2026-11-22T19:25:35.0403738Z   Parameter thread safety: Message thread calls setValueNotifyingHost() 500x on all params. Simultaneously, this thread calls setValue() and processBlock() 500x
2026-11-22T19:25:35.0404762Z   Background thread state: Opens editor on message thread. From background thread: getStateInformation(), randomise params, setStateInformation(). Sleeps 2s for async updates
2026-11-22T19:25:35.0405653Z   Parameters: Same as automatable parameters test - logs info for all non-bypass automatable parameters
2026-11-22T19:25:35.0406962Z   Discrete parameter state restoration: For each discrete param: sets a random value, saves state, then restores that state twice - once unchanged and once after setting a different value - and expects the same value both times
2026-11-22T19:25:35.0407877Z   Process called with a larger than prepared block size
2026-11-22T19:25:35.0408324Z   Allocations during process
